          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("I think I preferred the spider and the ants..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dwarf Leader",
            text: _("Stand firm, boys, here they come!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Troll Leader",
            text: _("You invade our tunnels, you slaughter our people, by Griknagh we will make you pay!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dwarf Leader",
            text: _("Tenacious savages, aren’t they? But these tunnels are rich in ore, and we won’t let a couple of trolls keep them from us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Troll Leader",
            text: _("Wait... What... Who are you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Uh..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dwarf Leader",
            text: _("What by the names of my forefathers are they?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "first_dwarf",
            text: _("Wait a minute... Vacuous eyes, pointy ears — they must be elves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "second_dwarf",
            text: _("Elves?! What in the nine hells are elves doing down here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dwarf Leader",
            text: _("Never mind that, who are you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("I am Kaleh, and we are the Quenoth Elves. What in Eloh’s name is going on here?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Troll Leader",
            text: _("They invade our land and kill our young. Dwarves always want more, always greedy for glittery rocks."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dwarf Leader",
            text: _("Those monsters killed me boys. Kaleh, if you be of stout heart, help us drive these lummoxes from our tunnels."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Troll Leader",
            text: _("No, this is our home. Help us, little ones, and we will help you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("There’s too many of them for us to try to take them both on, and besides with all these branching tunnels we’ll have no idea which way to go. I think we should take them up on their offer; ally ourselves with one of the factions so we can get their help in finding a way back to the surface."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            portrait: "portraits/nym_moody.webp",
            text: _("But even if we do, what about all of our people? How can we safely escort them through this war zone?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("We won’t. If we keep the majority of our people hidden back up the passage we should be able to protect them, at least for a little while. In the meantime, we’ll go ahead and try to sort out this mess. I think you’re right Zhul, if we’re lucky we may just be able to negotiate a safe passage out of here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "dialogue",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "message",
                speaker: "$explorer.id",
                text: _("But they both look evenly matched. Who should we ally with?"),
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Let’s aid the dwarves."),
                event: "ev_7_opt0",
              },
              {
                tag: "choice",
                text: _("Let’s aid the trolls."),
                event: "ev_7_opt1",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "battle.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "$explorer.id",
            text: _("There seems to be an abandoned dwarvish fortress right in front of us. If we can fight our way to the keep, we should be able to start rallying our warriors to help in the battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_14",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_15",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_16",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_17",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Fundin",
            type: "Dwarvish Explorer",
            side: 4,
            x: 25,
            y: 11,
