      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_38",
        on: "troll_victory_test",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Uu",
            cells: "21,13;20,13;19,13;18,14;18,15;17,15;16,16",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Zurg",
            type: "Troll Shaman",
            side: 2,
            x: 19,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Zurg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "18-22",
            ys: "11-15",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 200,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zurg",
            text: _("Congratulations! Some of trolls didn’t think you strong enough to beat dwarves."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Where did you come from?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zurg",
            text: _("There many secret tunnels that you sun dwellers not know of. Only troll know. We smarter than you think. Zurg would have killed dwarves himself, but he was just sent back from where real fighting is."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("The real fighting? I thought that was what we were waist-deep in?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zurg",
            text: _("While you fighting, another clan of dwarves sneak around and flank us. They tricksy like that. We must leave you and run back to defend women and little trolls. Dwarves never give up, many trolls die today, very hard fighting. But dwarves make mistake, you stronger than dwarf or troll thought. You trolls’ secret weapon."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("How do you mean?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zurg",
            text: _("Right before battle, we find secret passage just to the north leading straight to big dwarf stronghold. Hiding in stronghold is big important dwarf, directing the battle. Dwarves always think they best fighters around so they leave only a few dwarves guarding their stronghold. If you elves can break through dwarf defenses and kill dwarf chieftain, then it will do much damage to dwarves, make them afraid and confused, easy prey for trolls. You do this and we can drive them back. Then troll leader can help show you how to return to surface. You come with Zurg, he show you way to secret passage."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyssa",
            text: _("Their knowledge of these tunnels is uncanny. I could have sworn a minute ago that that wall was solid rock."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_39",
        on: "dwarf_victory_test",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Uu",
            cells: "23,43;22,44;21,44;20,45;19,45;18,45;17,44",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 200,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Grimnir",
            type: "Dwarvish Pathfinder",
            side: 5,
            x: 20,
            y: 45,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Grimnir",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:clear_shroud",
            side: 1,
            xs: "19-25",
            ys: "42-45",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grimnir",
            text: _("Congratulations, some of me boys didn’t think you could beat the trolls."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kaleh",
            text: _("Where did you come from?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grimnir",
            text: _("Don’t think you know all the tunnels and passages that twist through these caves, elf. I would have killed him myself, but I was just sent back from the main front of the battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Zhul",
            text: _("The front? I thought this was the front."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grimnir",
            text: _("While you were fighting, a separate clan of trolls sneaked around our sentries and flanked us, attacking our supply depots. There are more of those stinking buggers than we had originally thought. To tell you the truth, we are hard pressed. We’re going to have to pull back all our forces in these caves to reinforce the back lines. But your victory here has produced a unexpected opportunity."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Nym",
            text: _("It has?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grimnir",
            text: _("Right before the trolls overran this area of the mines, our scouts had found an old tunnel south of here that leads almost straight to the main lair of this tribe of trolls. We believe that protected in the lair is one of their main leaders who is directing the battle. We were going to try to sneak in and lead a surprise attack, but frankly we didn’t have enough dwarves to spare. If by using this passage you can sneak past their front lines and kill him, then it will throw the trolls into disarray and relieve the pressure on our front lines. If you do this our king has promised to help you return your people to the sunlit lands. When you’re ready I’ll show you the way. It’s not far."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyssa",
            text: _("Their knowledge of these tunnels is uncanny. I could have sworn a minute ago that that wall was solid rock."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_40",
